00:04:26.607 --> 00:04:28.422
Somewhere between one and two

00:04:28.422 --> 00:04:30.598
million were killed, at a time when

00:04:30.598 --> 00:04:32.930
14 million people were displaced.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.337
So, her origin story is in

00:04:34.337 --> 00:04:35.746
the midst of that strife.

00:04:35.746 --> 00:04:37.158
Settled in New Delhi,

00:04:37.158 --> 00:04:39.172
