00:04:44.748 --> 00:04:46.340
So, it was financially

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.174
extremely stressful, and

00:04:48.174 --> 00:04:50.173
her mother was a child bride.

00:04:50.173 --> 00:04:52.559
