00:04:52.559 --> 00:04:55.422
10 or 11, married by 12 or 13, two

00:04:55.422 --> 00:04:57.730
miscarriages as a teenager, then

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.054
two children who died in infancy.

00:05:00.054 --> 00:05:01.742
And then seven children,

00:05:01.742 --> 00:05:03.590
the middle of him was my mom.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:05.918
And my mom's oldest sister,

00:05:05.918 --> 00:05:07.967
my mossy, delivered me,

00:05:07.967 --> 00:05:09.655
she became an OBGYN.

00:05:09.655 --> 00:05:11.080
And so, if you ever had this

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.754
dynamic in your family where you

00:05:12.754 --> 00:05:14.367
have an aunt who can say to you,

00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:15.607
I put you in this world,

00:05:15.607 --> 00:05:16.853
I can take you out of it.

00:05:16.853 --> 00:05:18.556
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; Being sassy.

00:05:18.556 --> 00:05:20.169
So, that was a bit on my mom's

00:05:20.169 --> 00:05:20.692
