00:05:20.692 --> 00:05:22.756
And my dad's family were kind of

00:05:22.756 --> 00:05:25.368
classic Scandinavian Midwesterners.

00:05:25.368 --> 00:05:29.355
So, Danish, Swedish, Norwegian,

00:05:29.355 --> 00:05:30.729
all of that.

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:31.450
And so,

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.440
I grew up in a biracial household.

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.276
And I think,

00:05:35.276 --> 00:05:37.327
maybe the most interesting part

00:05:37.327 --> 00:05:38.923
of that in retrospect for

00:05:38.923 --> 00:05:40.975
