00:05:40.975 --> 00:05:42.886
were around communication.

00:05:42.886 --> 00:05:43.467
And so,

00:05:43.467 --> 00:05:46.043
in my dad's family, you don't talk

00:05:46.043 --> 00:05:48.705
about small conflicts, those bubble

00:05:48.705 --> 00:05:50.799
