00:06:09.487 --> 00:06:10.405
My mom's a little

00:06:10.405 --> 00:06:11.454
different with us.

00:06:11.454 --> 00:06:13.015
And fast forward to later, now I'm

00:06:13.015 --> 00:06:14.578
