00:07:27.443 --> 00:07:29.280
&gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; And why men's pants?

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:32.917
&gt;&gt; Yeah, so, it was inverted,

00:07:32.917 --> 00:07:34.374
actually.

00:07:34.374 --> 00:07:36.448
Brian was the founder of Bonobos,

00:07:36.448 --> 00:07:38.314
