00:08:48.614 --> 00:08:49.200
the fabric,

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.760
which had never happened before.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.704
So, step one was Brian added

00:08:52.704 --> 00:08:54.487
stretch to khaki pants and

00:08:54.487 --> 00:08:56.918
wool pants, which was not a massive

00:08:56.918 --> 00:08:59.050
