00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.711
The other insight that Brian had

00:09:00.711 --> 00:09:03.130
was that pants are kind of boring.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:05.084
And so he developed this contrast

00:09:05.084 --> 00:09:06.829
