00:09:06.829 --> 00:09:07.956
the back pockets.

00:09:07.956 --> 00:09:08.919
They would kind of

00:09:08.919 --> 00:09:11.051
create a conversation, they called

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:13.045
it conversational prints in a very

00:09:13.045 --> 00:09:15.177
specific place, and he started just

00:09:15.177 --> 00:09:17.187
